  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">使用這些模組：</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1207952/description_fc0d694e-f74d-48dd-933d-72900767d08c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"195\" height=\"195\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>L_Ender's Cataclysm</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1207952/description_a871695f-8613-46cc-9d2c-eae3b7012277.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"199\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Deeper and Darker</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">我在鍛造台新增了將監守者鎧甲升級為燃素鎧甲與詛咒鎧甲的配方。這樣即可保留你原本的附魔。對於想在不同模組間平滑過渡的玩家來說，這是個完美的補充。</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">查看圖片以了解新增的配方！</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">無需依賴其他模組！</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">僅包含鍛造配方！</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">與以下其他模組相容：</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1207952/description_1a1659a6-c4e1-4ac8-a280-6cb83d11f7c8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"125\" height=\"116\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Cataclysm Weaponery!</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1207952/description_3225d611-c241-46f7-bb3a-2f2af08ef759.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"126\" height=\"118\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Cataclysm Tools!</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
